  - Program source code must be written in English.
  - Source code must compile without errors.
  - In Javadoc @author tag include only the u-Kürzel.
  - Calls to System.exit(), Runtime.exit() or similar must not be used.
  - Do not add personal data to submissions beyond the u-Kürzel.
  - The board size argument must be a positive odd integer greater than 4 and not exceed 12345.
  - Maximum source code line width is 120 characters.
